  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Each book has over 200 individual LEGO parts, and features a fully functional spine, cover, and pages. The illustrations are printed on vinyl and they highlight some of Himber's personal Steampunk models.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Steampunk is a formal term that refers to a subgenre of speculative science fiction set in an anachronistic 19th century society. In other words, it is a fun, fantasy style that is full of lots of whimsy and interesting hand-craftiness in brass and wood. It is my main muse when I design and build"--Artist's statement from Vamp &amp; Tramp website.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="590" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Manuscript, Archives, and Rare Book Library copy is no. 28, signed by Himber.</subfield>
  </datafield>
